{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t中國香港代表團在名古屋亞運共贏得11金、19銀、24銅，總共54面獎牌，獎牌和金牌數目都打破紀錄，創下歷屆亞運最佳成績。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n行政長官李家超出席嘉許禮，他表示，特區政府重視體育發展，未來將繼續投放資源完善培訓和支援。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：劉景輝\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:56.147993+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:38:35.840151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:25.590673+00:00","content_hash":"617b94c25e893d8b386e8dd8dea74cc85ff3adc154a955e28584a491875c097b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}